    "html": "<p>A planet P has a diameter one-third that of the Earth. The mass of Earth is 18 times that of P</p>\n<p>The gravitational field strength at the surface of the Earth is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the gravitational field strength at the surface of P?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{6}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2g\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6g\"></span></li></ol>"
